  "hostNotes": "Any plausible hotel-room item is correct; rarity among the room does the scoring, so the bank mostly merges variants. Confirmed RACV Torquay specifics worth rewarding when unique: Nespresso machine, locally sourced gourmet minibar, robes and slippers, pillow menu, deep-soak Roman spa bath (Ocean Spa Suites), Juliet balcony, smartphone dock, alarm clock, L'Occitane amenities (per a Jetstar listing; brands rotate), interconnecting family rooms, soundproofing. Traps: bare 'robe' = bathrobe not wardrobe; unspecified 'a view' groups with Ocean view (golf course view is separate); 'table' groups with Desk; 'spa' means spa bath; 'chocolate' = minibar unless they say pillow. Entries noted as unverified (Bible, umbrella, turndown chocolate, RoyalAuto magazine, ottoman, dining table, Foxtel) are host-discretion accepts. Brought-in items (surfboards, wetsuits, golf clubs) and gags (sand, a hangover, Rip Curl bags) are host's call; group people answers under RACV members or Housekeeping."
